      "worked": "For example, $13, 13, 15, 16$ are four whole numbers in ascending order. The middle two values are $13$ and $15$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{13+15}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=14\\\\\\text{Range}&=16-13\\\\\\text{Range}&=3\\end{align*}$$",
